      "prompt": "A wide shallow tray on the left holds a large crowd of identical small cards standing upright like filed documents; every card is blank except for two thin grey placeholder lines. In the center, a simple flat-vector robot sorts these cards onto a long horizontal balance beam resting on a single central pivot: most cards have already slid to the far left end or the far right end of the beam and rest there in two settled piles, while exactly three cards sit balanced right on top of the central pivot, tilting slightly, unable to fall either way. The robot lifts only those three balanced middle cards and hands them across to a person seated on the right, who holds a pen and marks each of the three cards. A thin curved arrow loops from the marked cards in the person's hand back to the robot. The two settled piles at the ends of the beam are never handed over and stay untouched.",
