      "prompt": "Two side-by-side panels separated by one thin vertical divider line down the middle. Both panels show the same flat-vector robot standing in front of the same crowd of upright blank cards. LEFT PANEL: the robot reaches for the cards nearest to it, each already carrying one clear solid blue badge shape, and presses its own small stamp onto them by itself, stacking them into a growing pile at its own feet; a person stands at the far left edge of the panel with arms hanging down and empty hands, clearly left out of the action. RIGHT PANEL: the robot instead picks out the cards whose badge is split half blue and half grey, holds them up, and hands them across to a person seated on the right who marks each card with a pen and passes it back along a short curved arrow; the cards with solid blue badges stay behind in the crowd, untouched. The contrast to read at a glance: on the left the robot answers by itself and the person is unused, on the right the robot gives away the cards it cannot judge and the person answers them.",
